#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-building.rst:4 048b7b4c08014c459f0de0dd03dbffc5
msgid "Building a QuadPlane"
msgstr "构建 QuadPlane"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-building.rst:6 bc487831f02344628ef8575030cec275
msgid ""
"Putting together a QuadPlane involves careful planning. This page will "
"give you some general guidance on design principles for QuadPlanes that "
"may help you with your build."
msgstr "组装一架 QuadPlane 需要仔细规划。本页将为您提供一些 QuadPlane 设计原则方面的总体指导，以帮助您进行构建。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-building.rst:14 5cc28d12317246dcaeef10b09cdfa5e5
msgid "General Rules"
msgstr "一般规则"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-building.rst:16 5c6dba33e564406796dd85790b1a0047
msgid ""
"A wide range of fixed wing aircraft can be converted to have VTOL "
"capabilities. While ArduPilot uses the name QuadPlane for these aircraft,"
" you are not restricted to just QuadCopter motor layouts. Almost any "
"multicopter motor arrangement can be used with a QuadPlane, including "
"quad, hexa, tricoper, octa and octaquad. In addition, tilting motors to "
"allow their use in both VTOL and Fixed Wing flight is possible. Finally, "
"versions which use a vertical stance (nose vertical) for VTOL operations "
"are possible."
msgstr ""
"多种类型的固定翼飞机均可改装为具备 VTOL 能力的飞机。虽然 ArduPilot 将这类飞机称为 "
"QuadPlane，但您并不局限于四旋翼电机布局。几乎任何多旋翼电机排列方式均可用于 "
"QuadPlane，包括四轴、六轴、三轴、八轴和八轴四桨。此外，还可以使用倾转电机，使其既能用于 VTOL "
"飞行，也能用于固定翼飞行。最后，采用垂直姿态（机头朝上）进行 VTOL 操作的版本也是可行的。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-building.rst:25 bbd4d8e117624c9886c79d245ecffdb9
msgid "Some of the key factors to success are:"
msgstr "成功的关键因素包括："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-building.rst:27 374e0a3f9a5d480fa990863ca75ae524
msgid ""
"a fixed wing frame that can carry the weight of the additional lifting "
"motors and power system, along with any payload needed"
msgstr "固定翼机架能够承载额外升力电机和动力系统的重量，以及所需的任何有效载荷。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-building.rst:30 4593249092e74f3fab5cbaeecdc95ef7
msgid ""
"sufficient power in the lifting motors not just for the total airframe "
"weight, but also for the additional load that may be induced by downforce"
" on the wings for configurations using a horizontal VTOL stance."
msgstr "升力电机的功率不仅要足以支撑整个机架的重量，还要能够应对采用水平 VTOL 姿态的构型中机翼可能产生的额外向下载荷。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-building.rst:34 c2ddfee393b142059c41a7957bc99424
msgid ""
"complete clearance above and below the whole disk area of the lifting "
"motors, to ensure they achieve full aerodynamic thrust"
msgstr "升力电机整个桨盘区域的上下方均应完全净空，以确保实现完整的气动推力。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-building.rst:37 49f260d78b654c61a0edcb2fc477e8da
msgid ""
"minimum wing, frame, and mount twist and flex so the motors provide "
"thrust vertically at all times"
msgstr "机翼、机架和安装座的扭转和弯曲变形应尽量减小，以确保电机在任何时候均垂直提供推力。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-building.rst:40 c1ae1261dc7c4438bbdeacc4dcf0bba7
msgid "a sufficiently robust mounting system for the lifting motors"
msgstr "升力电机需要足够坚固的安装系统。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-building.rst:42 cd71fa65b2984e2787dd65b6060524b4
msgid "minimizing aerodynamic drag from the lifting motors and frame"
msgstr "尽量减少升力电机和机架产生的气动阻力。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-building.rst:47 32175b74df944a688a1eb86f74ae8005
msgid ""
"When you are designing a QuadPlane it is highly recommended that you make"
" use of `eCalc <http://ecalc.ch/>`__ to help choose the motors, ESCs, "
"batteries, propellers and other components of your design. Brushless "
"motors vary a lot in their power to weight ratio, and ensuring you choose"
" motors that keep the weight down while supplying sufficient lifting "
"power is important."
msgstr ""
"在设计 QuadPlane 时，强烈建议使用 `eCalc <http://ecalc.ch/>`__ "
"来帮助选择电机、ESC、电池、螺旋桨及其他组件。无刷电机的功率重量比差异很大，选择在保持重量较低的同时能提供足够升力的电机至关重要。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-building.rst:54 dcde08fcc2c94f558a23ff2ffb9dcc5d
msgid ""
"Due to their greater mass and surface area, most QuadPlanes do not have "
"as robust YAW authority as compared to small quadcopters (unless vectored"
" thrust is employed with tilt rotors). It is extremely important that the"
" motors be very well aligned, as just a few degrees offset can sometimes "
"effectively eliminate the ability to yaw in one or both directions. In "
"fact, this effect can be used to actually increase yaw authority by "
"purposely tilting one or both pairs of adjacent rotating motors in the "
"natural direction of their torque 1 or 2 degrees (inward for H frame, "
"outward for X and + frames)."
msgstr ""
"由于质量和表面积更大，大多数 QuadPlane "
"的偏航权威不如小型四旋翼飞机强（除非使用倾转旋翼的矢量推力）。电机对准极为重要，仅几度的偏差有时就能有效消除一个或两个方向的偏航能力。事实上，通过有意将一对或两对相邻反向旋转的电机向其自然扭矩方向倾斜1至2度（H"
" 型机架向内，X 型和 + 型机架向外），可利用这一效应实际提升偏航权威。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-building.rst:57 136358ffc290433fb1e5d8f28f5d2655
msgid "QuadPlane Range"
msgstr "QuadPlane 的航程"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-building.rst:59 35ad0d03799146ba878b184cc2ca7c6e
msgid ""
"Perhaps surprisingly, it is sometimes possible to increase the potential "
"range of an aircraft using a QuadPlane conversion. This may seem counter "
"intuitive as a QuadPlane conversion will both add weight and increase "
"aerodynamic drag to an airframe."
msgstr ""
"也许出乎意料，有时将飞机改装为 QuadPlane 后，潜在航程反而可能增加。这看似违反直觉，因为 QuadPlane "
"改装会同时增加飞机的重量和气动阻力。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-building.rst:64 0484ef03c0aa4a9ab4b86dae101dce71
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The reason why range can be increased is the extra carrying capacity of a"
" QuadPlane. Many fixed wing aircraft are limited in the amount of battery"
" they can carry due to the requirements for reliable launch. During "
"launch, and especially when using a flying launch such as a catapult or "
"bungee, the aircraft needs to rapidly accelerate to an airspeed above its"
" stall speed. If it fails to reach that speed sufficiently quickly then "
"it will crash. A QuadPlane avoids this problem by taking off vertically, "
"and can spend longer on the acceleration needed to sufficient speed for "
"forward flight."
msgstr ""
"航程能够增加的原因在于 QuadPlane "
"更强的载重能力。许多固定翼飞机由于可靠发射的要求，携带的电池量受到限制。在发射过程中，尤其是使用弹射器或橡皮筋等飞行发射方式时，飞机需要快速加速到超过失速速度的空速。若不能足够快地达到该速度，飞机将坠毁。QuadPlane"
" 通过垂直起飞避免了这一问题，可以花更多时间加速至向前飞行所需的速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-building.rst:74 b13092ecc52e47e280bb2392de6dd13d
msgid ""
"This means it is often possible to pack a lot more battery into a "
"QuadPlane than is possible in the same airframe without VTOL motors. The "
"extra battery capacity can more than make up for the increased weight and"
" drag of the VTOL motors."
msgstr ""
"这意味着，与同一机架的无 VTOL 电机版本相比，通常可以在 QuadPlane 中装载更多电池。额外的电池容量可以远远弥补 VTOL "
"电机带来的重量和阻力增加。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-building.rst:79 8a657699f23041ef9430538f4c17896f
msgid ""
"To make the most of this advantage you need to do very rapid VTOL "
"takeoffs and landings to minimise the battery consumption in VTOL flight."
" The video below demonstrates just how rapid a takeoff can be achieved "
"with a properly setup quadplane."
msgstr ""
"为充分利用这一优势，需要非常快速地完成 VTOL 起降，以最大限度减少 VTOL 飞行中的电池消耗。下面的视频展示了一架配置合理的 "
"quadplane 可以实现多快的起飞速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-building.rst:87 23dfbb756e374421827958699a21207e
msgid ""
"A second factor that can help with QuadPlane range is the flexibility "
"available in choosing the propeller and power train for the forward "
"motor. As conventional takeoff is not needed the forward motor does not "
"need to be optimised for the high level of thrust needed for takeoff. "
"This can allow larger propellers and geared motors to be used that are "
"highly efficient for forward cruise flight."
msgstr ""
"另一个有助于提升 QuadPlane "
"航程的因素是在选择前向电机的螺旋桨和动力系统时可获得的灵活性。由于不需要传统起飞，前向电机无需针对起飞所需的高推力进行优化。这使得可以使用更大的螺旋桨和齿轮减速电机，从而在向前巡航飞行时实现更高效率。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-building.rst:94 377ced9d4cfa4949be1b9557e4b3f5ed
msgid ""
"Finally, for really long range with a QuadPlane you can use an internal "
"combustion engine for the forward motor. A gas engine can run for a lot "
"longer than an electric motor with the same weight of fuel."
msgstr "最后，对于追求极长航程的 QuadPlane，可以使用内燃机作为前向电机。同等重量的燃油，汽油发动机的续航时间远超电动电机。"

